#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:494
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"注意: {mode} で比較したバンドルの走査範囲 ({um}) "
"が異なります（{groups}）。枠で切れたファイバーは短く測られ、分布は短い側に偏ります。その大きさは走査範囲に対する繊維の長さで変わります。そのため走査範囲の違うバンドルの間の長さの差には、撮像条件の違いも含まれます。{ml}"
" を使うと、この偏りは小さくなります。"
msgstr ""
"Note: the bundles compared under {mode} differ in scan size in {um} "
"({groups}). Fibers cut by the frame are measured short, which biases the "
"distribution toward short fibers, by an amount that depends on how long "
"the fibers are against the scan, so a length difference between bundles "
"of different scan sizes partly reflects how they were imaged. {ml} "
"reduces this bias."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:501
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"注意: {exclude} で比較したバンドルの走査範囲 ({um}) "
"が異なります（{groups}）。枠に達したファイバーを外すと分布は短い側に偏り、その大きさは走査範囲に対する繊維の長さで変わります。そのため走査範囲の違うバンドルの間の長さの差には、撮像条件の違いも含まれます。{ml}"
" を使うと、この偏りは小さくなります。"
msgstr ""
"Note: the bundles compared under {exclude} differ in scan size in {um} "
"({groups}). Leaving out the fibers that reach the frame biases the "
"distribution toward short fibers, by an amount that depends on how long "
"the fibers are against the scan, so a length difference between bundles "
"of different scan sizes partly reflects how they were imaged. {ml} "
"reduces this bias."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:546
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"注意: 比較したバンドルのキンクのしきい値が {values} "
"度と異なります。キンクの定義が違うため、群の差にはしきい値の違いも含まれます。そろえるには、Image Preprocessor "
"で同じしきい値（{param}）で解析し直してください。"
msgstr ""
"Note: the kink thresholds of the compared bundles differ ({values} "
"degrees). They are different definitions of a kink, so the group "
"differences include the difference in threshold. To align them, analyze "
"the bundles again in Image Preprocessor at one threshold ({param})."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:557
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"注意: 比較したバンドルのサンプリング間隔（nm/px）が {low}〜{high} nm/px "
"と異なります。キンクの検出は見かけの幅・サンプリング間隔（nm/px）・ノイズで変わるため（docs/validation.md "
"§4.4、§4.8）、群の差には撮像条件の違いも含まれます。"
msgstr ""
"Note: the compared bundles differ in pixel size, from {low} to {high} "
"nm/px. Kink detection changes with the apparent width, the pixel size and"
" the noise (docs/validation.md §4.4, §4.8), so the group differences also"
" contain a difference in imaging conditions."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:564
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"注意: 比較したバンドルの形式が {versions} "
"と混在しています。形式によって見かけの幅やキンクの探し方の定義が違うため、同じ版で解析し直すことを勧めます。"
msgstr ""
"Note: the compared bundles mix formats {versions}. Formats differ in how "
"they define the apparent width and search for kinks, so analyzing them "
"again with one version is recommended."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:577
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"注意: 比較したバンドルのうち {n}/{total} 個は、繊維の高さが画素ノイズの {limit:g} 倍未満です（最小 "
"{ratio:.1f} 倍）。ノイズが大きいと太い繊維の幅が短く読まれ、キンクを判定する尺度が変わります（docs/validation.md "
"§4.16、§4.17）。"
msgstr ""
"Note: in {n}/{total} of the compared bundles the fiber height is under "
"{limit:g} times the pixel noise (lowest {ratio:.1f}). With more noise a "
"wide fiber's width reads short, which changes the scale kinks are judged "
"at (docs/validation.md §4.16, §4.17)."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:617
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"注意: 比較したバンドルの中心線が {lines} "
"と異なります。長さ・高さ・曲率・キンクはすべて中心線に沿って測るため、群の差には中心線の違いも含まれます。同じ中心線で解析し直すと、この違いは無くなります。"
msgstr ""
"Note: the compared bundles differ in centerline ({lines}). Every length, "
"height, curvature and kink is measured along the centerline, so the group"
" differences include the difference in centerline. Analyzing them again "
"on one centerline removes it."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1205
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] 標本の {pct}% がヒストグラム範囲外です（統計値は範囲外を含む全標本から計算しています）"
msgstr ""
"[{grp}] {pct}% of the samples fall outside the histogram range "
"(statistics are computed from the whole sample, including what is "
"outside)"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1380
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{fiber} 集計は、同じ画像のファイバーを独立な標本として検定しています。p "
"値はファイバー本数とともに小さくなります。場所ごとの違いを踏まえて比べるには、{image} 集計で検定してください。"
msgstr ""
"{fiber} aggregation tests the fibers of one image as independent samples,"
" so the p-value shrinks with the number of fibers. To compare with the "
"difference between places taken into account, test with {image} "
"aggregation."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1411
msgid ""
"結論は Mann-Whitney の p 値で述べてください。KS "
"は分布の形の違いを見る参考値です。補正はこの計測量のペアだけにかかるため、複数の計測量を検定して述べるときは別に補正が必要です。"
msgstr ""
"State conclusions with the Mann-Whitney p-value. KS is a reference for "
"differences in the shape of the distribution. The correction covers the "
"pairs of this quantity only, so reporting tests of several quantities "
"needs a further correction."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1450
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{mode} の長さは枠の影響で短い側に偏り、長いファイバーの群ほど大きく短縮されます。この p "
"値と効果量には、その偏りの差も含まれます。補正して検定するには、枠の扱いを {ml} に、集計単位を {image} にしてください。"
msgstr ""
"Lengths under {mode} are biased short by the frame, and a group of longer"
" fibers is shortened more, so this p-value and effect size also hold that"
" difference in bias. To test with the correction, set the frame mode to "
"{ml} and the unit to {image}."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:1505
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"次のペアは、同じ値が無ければ 2 群が完全に分かれても p 値が {alpha} 未満になりません（値はこの標本数で到達しうる最小の p 値）: "
"{pairs}。これらのペアの「有意差なし」は、差が無いことを示しません。"
msgstr ""
"Without equal values, the following pairs cannot reach p < {alpha} even "
"when the two groups do not overlap at all (each value is the smallest "
"p-value attainable at these sample sizes): {pairs}. For these pairs, "
"\"not significant\" does not show that there is no difference."

