msgid "ほか {n} 組"
msgstr "and {n} more pairs"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5179
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"グループ「{grp}」に、同じ入力ファイルの同じ走査線を解析した結果が複数あります。重なった部分の繊維を二度数えるため、集計しません。次の各組のどちらかをグループから外してください。"
"\n"
"{pairs}"
msgstr ""
"Group \"{grp}\" holds more than one analysis of the same scan lines of "
"one input file. The fibers of the overlap would be counted twice, so "
"nothing is aggregated. Remove one file of each pair below from the group."
"\n"
"{pairs}"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5189
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] {n} 件の入力には元の入力ファイルの記録が無いため、同じ走査線の解析が重なっていないかはファイル名だけで確かめました。"
msgstr ""
"[{grp}] {n} inputs do not record their input file, so whether analyses of"
" the same scan lines overlap was checked by file name only."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5209
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] 計測できるファイルがありません"
msgstr "[{grp}] No file to measure"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5231
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] {n} バンドルを計測中..."
msgstr "[{grp}] Measuring {n} bundles..."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5242
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] 連結を適用: {n}/{total} バンドル"
msgstr "[{grp}] Connection applied: {n}/{total} bundles"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5244
msgid "（残りは骨格断片のまま集計）"
msgstr " (the rest are aggregated as skeleton fragments)"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5264
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[{grp}] {n}/{total} バンドルは旧版（形式 "
"1.0）で解析されています。保存されたスケルトンをそのまま追跡してスケルトンに沿って計測するため、現在の解析が取り除く小ループや行き止まりの短い枝でファイバーが分断されていることがあります。GUI01"
" で再解析してください"
msgstr ""
"[{grp}] {n}/{total} bundles were analyzed by an earlier version (format "
"1.0). Their stored skeletons are traced as they are and measured along "
"the skeleton, so fibers may be split at small loops and short dead-end "
"branches that the current analysis removes. Re-analyze them in GUI01"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5280
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] 中心線: {lines}"
msgstr "[{grp}] Centerline: {lines}"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5319
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] {param} の抽出に失敗: {err}"
msgstr "[{grp}] {param} extraction failed: {err}"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5344
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] 手動除外を適用: スケルトンの断片 {total} 個のうち {n} 個を除外しました"
msgstr "[{grp}] Manual exclusions applied: {n} of {total} skeleton pieces excluded"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5349
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] 手動除外を適用: 追跡した {total} 本のうち {n} 本を除外しました"
msgstr "[{grp}] Manual exclusions applied: {n} of {total} traced fibers excluded"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5396
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] {name}: 枠の判定が記録されていないため、枠に達した本数に数えていません"
msgstr ""
"[{grp}] {name}: not counted among the fibers reaching the frame because "
"it records no frame test"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5404
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] {name}: 枠の判定が記録されていないため、長さの集計から外しました"
msgstr ""
"[{grp}] {name}: left out of the length statistics because it records no "
"frame test"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5411
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[{grp}] 長さ ({km}): {total} 本のうち、両端とも自身の端である {whole} 本で分布を推定し、片端が切れた {cut}"
" 本を打ち切りとして使いました。両端とも切れているか枠にかかる {none} 本は使っていません。全長を見たうち最長のファイバー "
"({longest:.0f} nm) より長い側にある {share:.0%} は、推定できません"
msgstr ""
"[{grp}] Length ({km}): of {total} fibers, the distribution was estimated "
"from the {whole} with both ends their own, using the {cut} cut at one end"
" as censored. The {none} with both ends cut or on the frame were not "
"used. The {share:.0%} beyond the longest fiber seen whole ({longest:.0f} "
"nm) cannot be estimated"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5427
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[{grp}] 長さ: 枠に達したファイバー {n}/{total} 本を除外しました。残りのうち {k} "
"本は交差などで切れた端を持ち、長さは下限値です"
msgstr ""
"[{grp}] Length: excluded {n}/{total} fibers that reach the frame. Of the "
"rest, {k} have an end cut at a crossing or similar, so their length is a "
"lower bound"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5441
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] 読込失敗: {base} ({err})"
msgstr "[{grp}] Load failed: {base} ({err})"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5448
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] データ 0 件のためスキップしました"
msgstr "[{grp}] Skipped because there are 0 data points"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5472
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[{grp}] 長さ ({km}): ファイバーを {n} 回リサンプリングした 95 % 区間は、第 1 四分位数 {q1}、中央値 "
"{md}、第 3 四分位数 {q3} nm です"
msgstr ""
"[{grp}] Length ({km}): the 95 % interval from resampling the fibers {n} "
"times is {q1} for the first quartile, {md} for the median and {q3} for "
"the third quartile, in nm"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5559
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[{g}] {mode} 重みの有効標本数は {neff:.1f} 本（計測した {n} 本）で、最大の重みを持つ 1 本が重みの合計の "
"{share:.0%} を占めます。"
msgstr ""
"[{g}] The effective sample size of the {mode} weights is {neff:.1f} "
"fibers ({n} measured), and the fiber with the largest weight carries "
"{share:.0%} of the total weight."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5565
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"[{g}] 長さ: {total} 本のうち {n} 本 ({share:.0%}) が枠に達し、ほかに {k} "
"本が交差などで切れた端を持ちます。どちらの長さも下限値です。"
msgstr ""
"[{g}] Length: of {total} fibers, {n} ({share:.0%}) reach the frame and "
"another {k} have an end cut at a crossing or the like. Both lengths are "
"lower bounds."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5579
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{g}] キンクを判定した尺度: 見かけの幅の中央値 {w:.1f} nm"
msgstr "[{g}] Scale the kinks were judged at: median apparent width {w:.1f} nm"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5585
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{g}] 背景の画素ノイズの中央値: {n:.3f} nm"
msgstr "[{g}] Median pixel noise of the background: {n:.3f} nm"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5593
#, python-brace-format
msgid "どのグループからも {param} のデータを得られませんでした。ログを確認してください。"
msgstr "Could not obtain {param} data from any group. Check the log."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5603
#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5834
msgid "ヒストグラム範囲の準備に失敗しました。"
msgstr "Failed to prepare the histogram range."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5639
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[{grp}] 標本が {n} 個しかないため、ヒストグラムの形状は解釈できません。テーブルの median と IQR を参照してください。"
msgstr ""
"[{grp}] With only {n} samples the histogram shape cannot be read; use the"
" median and IQR in the table."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5653
msgid "比較には 2 群以上が必要です。"
msgstr "A comparison needs at least two groups."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5656
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{unit} 集計の標本は独立観測ではないため検定しません。{fiber} か {image} の集計に切り替えてください。"
msgstr ""
"Samples aggregated per {unit} are not independent observations, so they "
"are not tested. Switch to the {fiber} or {image} unit."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5674
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{km} の標本は重み付きのため検定しません。枠で切れた長さを補正して検定するには、枠の扱いを {ml} に、集計単位を {image} "
"にしてください。{ml} は交差で切れた長さを補正しません。"
msgstr ""
"{km} samples are weighted, so they are not tested. To test with lengths "
"cut at the frame corrected, set the frame mode to {ml} and the unit to "
"{image}. {ml} does not correct lengths cut at a crossing."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5681
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{fiber} 集計の {ml} 補正の標本は重み付きのため検定しません。補正したまま検定するには {image} "
"の集計に切り替えてください。各画像の重み付き中央値を検定します。"
msgstr ""
"{ml}-corrected samples at the {fiber} unit are weighted, so they are not "
"tested. To test with the correction in place, switch to the {image} unit,"
" which tests the weighted median of each image."

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5692
#, python-brace-format
msgid "群間比較に失敗しました: {err}"
msgstr "Group comparison failed: {err}"

