msgid "主検定 Mann-Whitney は Holm 補正後（括弧内は補正前）。KS は補正なしの参考値"
msgstr ""
"Primary Mann-Whitney Holm-corrected (raw in parentheses); KS uncorrected,"
" as a reference"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Morphology_Statistics.py:5956
msgid "主検定は Mann-Whitney（2 群のため補正不要）。KS は参考値"
msgstr ""
"Primary test Mann-Whitney (no correction needed for two groups); KS as a "
"reference"

