#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:5845
msgid "連結の解除"
msgstr "Disconnection"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:5871
#, python-brace-format
msgid "すべての連結を解除しました: フィブリル {n} 本を断片へ戻しました。"
msgstr "Removed every connection: {n} fibril(s) taken back apart into fragments."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:5873
msgid "すべての連結の解除"
msgstr "Removal of every connection"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:5891
msgid "元に戻せる連結操作がありません。"
msgstr "There is no connection operation to undo."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:5895
#, python-brace-format
msgid "「{action}」を元に戻しました。"
msgstr "Undid \"{action}\"."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:5964
msgid "継ぎ目の折れもキンクとして判定します。連結したフィブリルのキンクを判定し直しました。"
msgstr ""
"Bends at bridges are now judged as kinks too. The kinks of the connected "
"fibrils were judged again."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:5969
#, python-brace-format
msgid "継ぎ目の折れは判定しません。連結したフィブリルのキンクを判定し直し、継ぎ目にかかる折れ {n} 箇所を判定しない折れ（マゼンタの菱形）にしました。"
msgstr ""
"Bends at bridges are not judged. The kinks of the connected fibrils were "
"judged again, and {n} bends at bridges are now unjudged bends (magenta "
"diamonds)."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:5975
msgid "自動連結のしきい値を更新しました。「自動連結」を実行すると反映されます。"
msgstr ""
"Updated the automatic connection thresholds. They take effect the next "
"time \"Auto Connect\" is run."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6041
#, python-brace-format
msgid "連結ファイルを読めませんでした: {err}"
msgstr "Could not read the connection file: {err}"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6061
#, python-brace-format
msgid "連結を復元しました: フィブリル {n} 本（断片 {m} 本）"
