msgstr "Individual View - {name} / fiber #{idx}"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6657
msgid "余白"
msgstr "Margin"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6667
msgid ""
"追跡範囲の周囲を何画素分まで表示に含めるかを指定します。\n"
"端点で終わったのか交差で切れたのかを周囲ごと確認できます。\n"
"表示専用の設定で、長さ・高さなどの計測値には影響しません。\n"
"0 を指定すると追跡範囲ぴったりの切り出しに戻ります。"
msgstr ""
"How many pixels around the tracked range are included in the view.\n"
"Showing the surroundings tells you whether tracking stopped at an end "
"point or at a crossing.\n"
"Display only: measured values such as length and height are unaffected.\n"
"Set it to 0 to go back to a crop that fits the tracked range exactly."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6676 guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6810
msgid "フォントサイズ：軸ラベル"
msgstr "Font Size: Axis Label"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6714 guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6877
msgid "表示："
msgstr "Display:"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6716 guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6879
msgid "キンク"
msgstr "Kinks"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6721
msgid "中心線"
msgstr "Centerline"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6726
msgid "追跡範囲"
msgstr "Tracked Range"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6732
msgid ""
"計測対象のファイバーを囲む破線枠を表示します。\n"
"余白に隣接ファイバーが写り込んでも、どれが計測対象かを取り違えずに済みます。"
msgstr ""
"Draws a dashed box around the fiber being measured.\n"
"Even when the margin brings neighboring fibers into the frame, it stays "
"clear which fiber is the measured one."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6801
msgid "Y最大"
msgstr "Y max"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6854
msgid "グリッド表示"
msgstr "Show Grid"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6862
msgid "凡例位置"
msgstr "Legend Position"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6884
msgid "中央値/最大値"
msgstr "Median/Max"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6933
msgid "拡大像の設定値が不正です。"
msgstr "Zoom view settings are invalid."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6941
#, python-brace-format
msgid "余白は 0〜{max} px の範囲で入力してください。"
msgstr "Enter a margin in the range 0-{max} px."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:6975
msgid "プロファイルの設定値が不正です。"
msgstr "Profile settings are invalid."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7004
msgid "y軸最大値には正の数値を入力してください。"
msgstr "Enter a positive number for the Y-axis maximum."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7440
msgid "ファイバー連結の設定"
msgstr "Fiber Connection Settings"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7450
msgid "連結距離"
msgstr "Connection distance"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7451
msgid "端点どうしがこの距離以内なら連結候補にする。"
msgstr "Endpoints within this distance of each other become connection candidates."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7452
msgid "直線性の角度しきい値"
msgstr "Linearity angle threshold"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7453
msgid "両端点の角度がこの値を超える（＝ほぼ直線）ときのみ連結する。"
msgstr ""
"Connect only when the angle at the two endpoints exceeds this value (i.e."
" nearly straight)."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7454
msgid "方向推定の振り返り点数"
msgstr "Look-back points for direction estimation"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7455
msgid "端点での向きを推定するのに使うトラック点数。"
msgstr "Number of tracked points used to estimate the direction at an endpoint."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7456
msgid "橋渡し高さの平均点数"
msgstr "Points averaged for the bridge height"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7457
msgid "連結部の高さを決めるために平均する端点サンプル数。"
msgstr ""
"Number of endpoint samples averaged to determine the height of the "
"connection."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7458
msgid "高さ差の許容比"
msgstr "Allowed height-difference ratio"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7459
msgid "高さ中央値の相対差がこの値以下の断片のみ連結する。大きいほど緩い。"
msgstr ""
"Connect only fragments whose median heights differ relatively by at most "
"this value. Larger is more permissive."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7460
msgid "交差ノイズのトリミング点数"
msgstr "Trim points for crossing noise"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7461
msgid "連結前に接合部付近から切り落とす骨格点数。"
msgstr ""
"Number of skeleton points trimmed from around the junction before "
"connecting."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7482
msgid "継ぎ目の折れもキンクとして判定する"
msgstr "Judge bends at bridges as kinks too"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7487
msgid ""
"連結した継ぎ目（繊維が見えていない隙間を直線でつないだ部分）にかかる折れを、キンクとして判定するかどうか。外すと、それらの折れは判定せず、個別表示のウインドウと"
" AFM "
"全体像にマゼンタの白抜きの菱形で表示し、キンク数にもキンク密度にも数えません。どちらの場合も、継ぎ目そのものの長さはキンク密度の分母に含めません。形式"
" 1.0 のバンドルでは、この設定は効きません。"
msgstr ""
"Whether bends at a connection bridge (the straight segment drawn across a"
" gap where no fiber is visible) are judged as kinks. When unchecked, such"
" bends are not judged: the Individual View window and the AFM Overview "
"show them as hollow magenta diamonds, and they are counted neither in the"
" kink count nor in the kink density. Either way, the length of the bridge"
" itself is not included in the kink density's divisor. This setting has "
"no effect on a format 1.0 bundle."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7497
msgid "適用"
msgstr "Apply"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7498
msgid "既定値に戻す"
msgstr "Restore Initial Values"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7528
msgid "正の数値を入力してください。"
msgstr "must be a positive number."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7530
msgid "0 より大きく 180 以下の角度を入力してください。"
msgstr "Enter an angle greater than 0 and no more than 180."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7532
msgid "2 以上の整数を入力してください。"
msgstr "must be an integer of 2 or more."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7534
msgid "1 以上の整数を入力してください。"
msgstr "must be an integer of 1 or more."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7536
msgid "0 以上の整数を入力してください。"
msgstr "must be an integer of 0 or more."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7550
msgid "入力エラー"
msgstr "Input Error"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7616
msgid "連結先の候補"
msgstr "Connection Candidates"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7621
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ファイバー #{n} の連結先を選んでください。距離は端どうしの画素距離、角度は連結部の直線性です。「自動」が ✓ "
"の候補は自動連結でも連結される条件を満たしています。"
msgstr ""
"Choose what to connect fiber #{n} to. The distance is between the two "
"ends in pixels, and the angle is the straightness at the join. A "
"candidate marked ✓ under \"Auto\" also meets the conditions the automatic"
" connection uses."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7662
msgid "この候補と連結"
msgstr "Connect to this candidate"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7719
msgid "連結する候補を選択してください。"
msgstr "Select the candidate to connect to."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7768
msgid "連結の一覧"
msgstr "Connections"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7773
msgid ""
"連結部の一覧です。行を選ぶと全体像で連結部を丸で示します。位置は全体像の画素座標、gap は繋いだ 2 "
"端の画素距離です。複数行を選んでまとめて解除できます。"
msgstr ""
"Every junction in the image. Selecting a row circles the junction on the "
"overview. Positions are overview pixel coordinates, and gap is the pixel "
"distance between the two joined ends. Select several rows to disconnect "
"them together."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7784
msgid "選択した連結を解除"
msgstr "Disconnect selected"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7786
msgid "すべての連結を解除"
msgstr "Disconnect all"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7880
msgid "解除する連結を選択してください。"
msgstr "Select the junctions to disconnect."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7893
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"すべての連結（{n} 箇所）を解除します。\n"
"「元に戻す」で 1 回で元に戻せます。よろしいですか？"
msgstr ""
"Every connection ({n} junction(s)) will be removed.\n"
"One press of \"Undo\" brings them back. Continue?"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7938
msgid "除外したファイバー"
msgstr "Excluded Fibers"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7943
#, python-brace-format
msgid "位置は全体像の画素座標です。除外はバンドル横の {suffix} に保存されます。"
msgstr ""
"Positions are whole-image pixel coordinates. Exclusions are saved as "
"{suffix} beside the bundle."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7969
msgid "選択を解除"
msgstr "Restore selected"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7971
msgid "すべて解除"
msgstr "Restore all"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:7999
msgid "解除する行を選択してください。"
msgstr "Select the row to restore."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:8011
#, python-brace-format
msgid "除外を解除しました: 位置 ({x}, {y})"
msgstr "Restored the fiber at ({x}, {y})"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:8029
#, python-brace-format
msgid "このデータセットの除外 {n} 件をすべて解除しますか？"
msgstr "Restore all {n} exclusions for this dataset?"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:8038
#, python-brace-format
msgid "除外をすべて解除しました: {n} 件"
msgstr "Restored all {n} exclusions."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:8074
msgid "ファイバー一覧の計測値の説明"
msgstr "Fiber List Measurements"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:8079
msgid "列見出しにマウスを乗せても、その値の説明が表示されます。"
msgstr "Hovering over a column heading also shows the explanation of that value."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:8086
#, python-brace-format
msgid "計算方法とそのコードは、リポジトリの {doc} の各節（§）で説明しています。"
msgstr ""
"The computation and its code are explained in the numbered sections (§) "
"of {doc} in the repository."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1368
msgid "フォルダやファイルを追加するか、一覧の枠へドロップしてください。"
msgstr "Add folders or files, or drop them onto the gallery."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1370
msgid "フォルダまたはファイルを追加してください。"
msgstr "Add folders or files."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1386
msgid "フォルダを追加"
msgstr "Add Folder"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1388
msgid "ファイルを追加"
msgstr "Add Files"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1394
msgid ""
"選択したサムネイルを一覧から削除します（ファイルはそのまま残ります）。\n"
"クリックで 1 つ選択、Ctrl+クリックで追加、Shift+クリックで範囲を選択します。"
msgstr ""
"Deletes the selected thumbnails from the gallery (the files stay where "
"they are).\n"
"Click selects one, Ctrl+click adds to the selection, and Shift+click "
"selects a range."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1397
msgid "全て削除"
msgstr "Delete All"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1401
msgid "すべてのサムネイルを一覧から削除します（ファイルはそのまま残ります）。"
msgstr "Deletes every thumbnail from the gallery (the files stay where they are)."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1406
msgid "並べ替え"
msgstr "Sort"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1408
msgid "名前順"
msgstr "By Name"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1410
msgid "更新日時順"
msgstr "By Date"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1415
msgid ""
"サムネイルは追加した順に並びます。ドラッグすると並べ替えられます（複数選択していれば、まとめて動かせます）。\n"
"このメニューは、現在の一覧をその順に 1 回並べ直します。"
msgstr ""
"Thumbnails appear in the order they were added. Drag one to rearrange "
"them (with several selected, they move together).\n"
"This menu puts the current gallery into the chosen order once."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1421
msgid "用紙"
msgstr "Paper"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1422
msgid "A4 縦"
msgstr "A4 portrait"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1422
msgid "A4 横"
msgstr "A4 landscape"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1425
msgid "列数"
msgstr "Columns"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1427
msgid "1 ページの 1 行に並べる画像の数です。"
msgstr "The number of images in one row of a page."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1431
msgid "行数"
msgstr "Rows"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1433
msgid "1 ページに並べる行の数です。"
msgstr "The number of rows on a page."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1442
msgid ""
"ページを画面に描く大きさです。100% は用紙の実寸です。\n"
"一覧の上で Ctrl を押しながらマウスホイールを回しても、倍率を変えられます。"
msgstr ""
"The size the pages are drawn at on the screen. 100% is the real size of "
"the paper.\n"
"Holding Ctrl and turning the mouse wheel over the gallery also changes "
"the zoom."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1446
msgid "幅に合わせる"
msgstr "Fit width"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1446
msgid "ページ全体"
msgstr "Whole page"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1452 guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:2893
#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:2896 guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:2916
msgid "シートを保存"
msgstr "Save Sheet"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1456
msgid ""
"画面に見えているとおりのページを、A4 のシートとして保存します。\n"
"PDF は全ページを 1 つのファイルに、PNG は 1 ページを 1 つのファイルに保存します（複数ページでは名前の末尾に _p01、_p02 "
"… が付きます）。"
msgstr ""
"Saves the pages as they appear on the screen, as A4 sheets.\n"
"A PDF holds every page in one file; a PNG is one file per page (with "
"several pages, _p01, _p02, ... is appended to the name)."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1461
msgid "保存後に開く"
msgstr "Open after saving"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1465
msgid ""
"保存したシートを既定のアプリで開きます。印刷はそのアプリから行います。\n"
"PNG で複数ページになった場合は 1 ページ目を開きます。"
msgstr ""
"Opens the saved sheet in the default application; print it from there.\n"
"For a PNG sheet of several pages, the first page is opened."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1479
msgid ""
"色の範囲は画像ごとに自動で決まります。サムネイルを選択して vmin / vmax を入力し、Enter "
"で確定すると、選択した画像の範囲が変わります。Ctrl+A ですべて選択できます。\n"
"複数選択で値が揃っていない側は空欄になります。空欄のまま確定した側は、各画像の値のまま変わりません。"
msgstr ""
"The color range of each image is set automatically. Select thumbnails, "
"enter vmin / vmax and press Enter to change the range of the selected "
"images. Ctrl+A selects them all.\n"
"With several selected, an entry is blank where their values differ. An "
"entry left blank when confirming keeps each image's own value."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1503
msgid "選択した画像の色範囲を、自動で決めた範囲に戻します。"
msgstr "Returns the color range of the selected images to the automatic range."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1511 guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:2975
msgid "スケールバー"
msgstr "Scale bar"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1515
msgid "各画像の下、画像の左端に合わせてスケールバーを表示します。走査範囲の記録が無いバンドルには表示しません。"
msgstr ""
"Shows a scale bar under each image, aligned with the image's left edge. "
"It is not shown for a bundle that records no scan size."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1522
msgid "各画像の下に、その画像の色と高さの対応を示すカラーバーを表示します。"
msgstr "Shows a color bar under each image, relating its colors to heights."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1531
msgid "ファイル名・スケールバー・カラーバーの文字の大きさを設定します。画面と保存するシートの両方に反映されます。"
msgstr ""
"Sets the text size of the file name, the scale bar and the color bar. It "
"applies to the screen and to the saved sheet alike."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1540
msgid "選択した画像を Plot Profiler で開きます。1 つにつきウィンドウが 1 つ開きます。"
msgstr "Opens the selected images in Plot Profiler, one window for each."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1542
msgid "GUI03で開く"
msgstr "Open in GUI03"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1546
msgid ""
"選択した画像を Fiber Morphology Statistics で開きます。選択した全画像が 1 つのグループに入った状態で、ウィンドウが"
" 1 つ開きます。"
msgstr ""
"Opens the selected images in Fiber Morphology Statistics. One window "
"opens, with every selected image in one group."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1553
msgid "選択した画像を Fiber Tracker で開きます。1 つにつきウィンドウが 1 つ開きます。"
msgstr "Opens the selected images in Fiber Tracker, one window for each."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1686
#, python-brace-format
msgid "ドラッグ＆ドロップは使えません（{reason}）。「フォルダを追加」「ファイルを追加」は使えます。"
msgstr ""
"Drag and drop is not available ({reason}). \"Add Folder\" and \"Add "
"Files\" still work."

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1792
msgid ".b2z バンドルを含むフォルダを選択"
msgstr "Select a folder containing .b2z bundles"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1851
#, python-brace-format
msgid "追加: {n_new} 件（既に一覧にあるため省略 {n_dup} 件、.b2z 以外のため無視 {n_ignored} 件）"
msgstr ""
"Added: {n_new} (skipped {n_dup} already in the gallery, ignored "
"{n_ignored} that are not .b2z)"

#: guis/GUI05_Thumbnail_Viewer.py:1872
#, python-brace-format
